concept fact {
  name     = "Fact"
  summary  = "A unit that holds factual data — a value, a constant, a value table."
  audience = :both
  related  = [concept, entity, process]
  body {
    p <<BODY
      A fact is a unit of knowledge that has a specific value and can't really be disputed or interpreted.
    BODY

    p <<BODY
      Some good examples of facts are like an API for a library. CPU Instructions. Details about historic events that happened.
    BODY
  }
}
